<title>POLAND: Swarzedz Q4 net turns to PLN 4.9 mln loss.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz Q4 net turns to PLN 4.9 mln loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
